{"ID":"20240118144956-40xeowt","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144956-40xeowt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144956-40xeowt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144956-ehswef5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170243-h3dhhvf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170243-h3dhhvf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:88,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:88\u0026#125;","title":"372补15白芷","type":"doc","updated":"20240204163943"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144956-ehswef5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144956-ehswef5","updated":"20240122170208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"——行手足阳明，入手太阴而为阳明主药、故治头面诸疾。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170212-knbu4lu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170212-knbu4lu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，根有轮节或隆起，外面色淡黄褐，气味甚香。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170214-xykunb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170214-xykunb2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，（或作甘）性温，无毒。色白入肺。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170217-j7v7vvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170217-j7v7vvz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】白芷为散风发表要药，功能通窍去湿，疗风行血，止头痛，和肠胃，烧之辟邪气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170219-xs5g3q6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170219-xs5g3q6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗风邪，久渴，吐呕，两胁满，头眩目痒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170220-9cif951","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170220-9cif951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】能蚀脓，止心腹血刺痛，女人沥血腰痛血崩。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170222-q3o0h64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170222-q3o0h64"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治目赤努肉，去面皯疵瘢，补胎瘘滑落，破宿血，补新血，乳痈，发背，一切痈疮疥癣，止痛排脓。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170223-ykr1p2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170223-ykr1p2t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】解利手阳明头痛，中风寒热，及肺经风热，头面皮肤风痹燥痒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170226-n9kbj55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170226-n9kbj55"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170227-grbki9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170227-grbki9l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】呕吐由于火，瘘下赤白，阴虚火炽，病由血热所至者，均忌，恶旋覆花，制雄黄硫黄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170229-k9s29f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170229-k9s29f1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【吴克潜】白芷为肺胃大肠三经气分药，亦入三经血分，擅散风去湿之功，配白芷治偏正头风，齿痛，带下者，成方颇多。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170230-v74h652","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170230-v74h652"}},{"ID":"20240122170230-e7beoau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170230-e7beoau"}},{"ID":"20240122170231-flwio3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170231-flwio3z","updated":"20240204163826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那第十五就是我们的白芷，白芷这个药，这个白芷呢长的你看这个颜色就是白的，这个白芷是我们阳明经的药，比如说我们讲阳明经头痛，一个人头痛有很多种头痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"前额痛就是阳明经的药前额额头痛，所以针灸上面我们前额痛的时候我们下中脘，处方的时候我们用白芷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170239-fvkuu4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170239-fvkuu4u","updated":"20240204163925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个白芷呢味道是辛辣，性温颜色色白刚刚你看嘛，颜色色白是入肺，所以它呢是散风发表的药，入肺的话就能够发表，能够通窍去湿，疗风行血，止头痛，那平常房子里面烧白芷去这种邪气意思就是说解消毒的意思嘛，那这个【甄权】呢能够去脓，肚子里面有脓的话，白芷能够止心腹的刺痛，像这个【大明】的话他说补胎啊胎滑落啊，身上有宿血啊，补新，血乳痈就是乳癌啊，那个发背疥癣都可以使用，那白芷呢这个【吴克潜】诸位看啊它可以肺胃大肠三经的气分的药，因为色是白色的所以它入气分。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170243-h3dhhvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170243-h3dhhvf","updated":"20240204163943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那使用上面呢我们这个白芷可以用两钱三钱，严重的头痛我们可以用到四钱五钱都没有关系，那这个白芷呢也可以打粉涂在脸上，像涂在脸上的药粉啊我们有玉肌散像有绿豆粉白芷啊这种都是很好的外敷的美容的药。"}]}]}